scene U: {Ns} mind runs the same calculation again and again: the rent, the debt, the job, the years, the odds.
scene B: Everyone else seems to be getting somewhere, and {N} still owns nothing that matters. The thought burns like hunger.
scene R: {Ns} chest is tight, the room is too small, and {N} wants to run somewhere, anywhere.
scene G: Outside, the wind moves the trees. {N} lies listening, feeling very small and very temporary.
- W | get up, write tomorrow's duties in a list, and go back to bed | v: security, conformity | chance: 90
- U | open a spreadsheet and plan the next ten years in detail | v: security, achievement | tech: computer | chance: 55
- B | decide that from tomorrow you look after number one, whatever it takes | identity | v: power, achievement | chance: 65
- R | get dressed and run through the empty streets until dawn | habit | v: stimulation | body: light | chance: 82
- G | open the window, listen to the night, and let the worry pass | v: none clear (acceptance) | chance: 68
- W>B | resolve to save a fixed sum every month until you own something | v: security, power (resources) | chance: 78
- U>R | research a year abroad and send off the application before dawn | door | binds | v: stimulation, self-direction | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 90
- B>G | cut off the friends who drain you, and keep only your own close | v: security | act: cut off the friends who drain them, and keep only their own close | chance: 65
- R>W | tell your parents at dawn, in tears, that you will get your life in order | binds | v: conformity, security | chance: 80
- G>U | sit with the worry and write down what it is trying to say | v: self-direction | chance: 78
