== a breakup
tier: life event
stages: young_adult adult
age: 16-40
per_year: 0 0 .25 .06 0 0
drivers: stress+.5 money-.3 family-.3 ties-.2 community-.2 unrest+.2 trouble+.15
needs: partner
domain: partner.5
ends: partner
rite: adult
times: about 25 in 100 young adults and 6 in 100 adults a year see a serious relationship end (D43, estimate; unmarried breakups, divorce is D44); zero to three times before forty
likelier: youth, a young or short partnership, stress, money worries, a move or distance, an affair, moving in too soon, war or unrest that keeps couples apart
rarer: marriage, children together, a long partnership, a close community, good friends around the couple, enough money, a faith or family that frowns on separating
tone: trouble
